@page "/wiki/shipsets"
@page "/wiki/shipsets/{Key}"

@*
    The shipsets, which the game names by showing you one.

    Fifty-two sets and two names between them - Spinovore and Shellcraft - because the game's own
    picker spins the model and never writes a name down. So the picture is the entry here, drawn
    during extraction rather than copied out of the installation, and the rest read as their key
    made readable.

    The second address is one entry of the shelf, as on every other page here.
*@

<PageTitle>Shipsets - Stellaris Empire Manager</PageTitle>

<WikiSection Kind="WikiKind.Shipsets" Focus="@Key" />

@code {
    /// <summary>The entry the address names, where it names one.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string? Key { get; set; }
}
